{\up $}{\footnote\pard\plain{\up $} Disk space is critical - free some space immediately}
{\up #}{\footnote\pard\plain{\up #} 153.UUP}
\pard \b Disk space is critical - free some space immediately
\par \plain\fs24 This message is given when the available space on drive C: has fallen below 10MB. You are advised to delete/archive  any redundant files immediately.
\par Failure to create more working space may result in loss of critical files and in extreme cases could lock up the system
\par 
\par  The LOG file  may be growing too large and require archiving. \f3\fs20 
\par \page
