{\up $}{\footnote\pard\plain{\up $} EHT - Set Tripped}
{\up #}{\footnote\pard\plain{\up #} BKOIXC}
\pard \f1\b\fs24 EHT - Set Tripped 
\par \plain\fs24 This error indicates a trip of the EHT set. 
\par This is typically caused by :
\par  1. Dirty firing unit 
\par  2. Incorrectly fitted filament (i.e. too close to aperture)
\par  3. Broken or cracked filament base
\par  4. Inadequate vacuum especially when high KV is used
\par \page
