\pard \b Write TIFF header Error
\par 
\par \plain\fs24 This error is given when writing a TIFF file. 
\par Either the file cannot be created or an error occurred when writing the TIFF header.
\par This is typically due to inadequate disk capacity.  Delete excess files.
\par \page
